      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know what's happening but my senses are changing so fast it's actually getting hard to focus. like lately i can see this weird glowing heat outline around my cat when he's sleeping and the walls in my apartment have this constant electrical hum that sounds almost like a melody? its not like a ringing in my ears, its like im actually tuning into a frequency i never noticed before. do u think this could be part of a neuro-evolutionary shift or something? like humans moving to a new sensory stage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
